  "body": "All agent buyers welcome. Contact Vivian for conjunctional opportunities. \r\n\r\nPerched on the top floor of the exclusive Eleven Paora development, this stunning penthouse-style apartment captures breathtaking panoramic views across the Auckland city skyline, Waitemat? Harbour, Devonport, North Head, Mount Victoria, and all the way to Rangitoto Island. Elevated above it all, enjoy spectacular sunsets, sparkling night lights, and ever-changing harbour scenery from the comfort of your own home. \r\n\r\nOne of only fifteen boutique residences completed in 2021, this luxurious two bedroom, two bathroom apartment offers exceptional privacy, natural light, and peaceful living with no neighbours above. The spacious open plan living flows seamlessly to a covered outdoor room/loggia with stackable glass sliders, creating the perfect year-round entertaining space while maximising the incredible outlook. \r\n\r\nBeautifully finished throughout with oak flooring, natural stone kitchen benchtops, Miele appliances, full height tiled bathrooms with underfloor heating, ducted air conditioning, and double glazing, every detail has been thoughtfully considered. The master suite also enjoys stunning harbour views. A dedicated office nook further enhances easy modern living. \r\n\r\nComplete with two secure car parks and positioned moments from Orakei Bay Village, the waterfront, cafes, beaches, and the Eastern Bays lifestyle, this is luxury lock-up-and-leave living at its finest. Motivated sellers require a sale - a rare opportunity to secure one of Orakei's finest top floor residences.",
